{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_357","type":"agent_message","text":"The corrected search is running, but its output is buffered and each exact state retains the full observational frame, so it is slower than the symbolic sweep. It is bounded at 1,200 states and depth 50 per placement; I’m letting the first batch finish because a hit here would provide both the ring route and the final avatar suffix."}}
